60,w:200,h:100,tone:"cyan",title:"QHAIN",sub:"ledger · PoQ mining",detail:"The blood. Every block is sealed by telemetry attestation before it counts. QUARTZ (QZ): fixed 21M cap, 100% genesis to ARCHITECT. QREDIT minted 1:1 against delivered compute."},{id:"qeed",x:620,y:60,w:200,h:100,tone:"amber",title:"QEED",sub:"foundation tithe · 10%",detail:"The conscience. A protocol-level 10% tithe of every block reward and every QREDIT mint routes to the QEED Foundation wallet. No function can bypass it. Verifiable by anyone, forever."},{id:"qloud",x:330,y:210,w:200,h:100,tone:"cyan",title:"QUBE",sub:"compute · agents · storage",detail:"The land. Queminal nodes (phones), Qerver nodes (laptops/desktops), future Qore racks. Every job executed feeds QLEARN — the Qube gets smarter with every customer."},{id:"qay",x:620,y:210,w:200,h:100,tone:"cyan",title:"QAY",sub:"payments bridge",detail:"The door. Phase A: Qube services sold in dollars through the Google Pay business account. Phase B: Qay wallet, QUARTZ exchange, settlement partner. Phase C: tap-to-pay."},{id:"foundation",x:620,y:360,w:200,h:110,tone:"amber",title:"FOUNDATION",sub:"QuantumForge",detail:"The mission. Self-sustainable communities for the homeless, Heaven's Kitchen, shelters for battered women and children, justice reform. Funded by protocol, not promises."},{id:"queminal",x:40,y:360,w:200,h:110,tone:"dim",title:"QUEMINAL",sub:"node zero · this device",detail:"Node zero. The terminal in your pocket and on your desk. JLSQ runtime, Qoice voice interface, Foundry agents, and the Qhain wallet live here."}],_5=[{from:"qircuit",to:"qhain",label:"work packets",tone:"cyan"},{from:"qircuit",to:"qloud",label:"compute",tone:"cyan"},{from:"qhain",to:"qeed",label:"10% tithe",tone:"amber"},{from:"qloud",to:"qay",label:"services",tone:"cyan"},{from:"qeed",to:"foundation",label:"funds",tone:"amber"},{from:"qay",to:"foundation",label:"revenue",tone:"amber"},{from:"queminal",to:"qircuit",label:"runs",tone:"cyan"},{from:"queminal"