,eyebrow:"// build qrew",title:"Hire an AI Crew to Build Your App",intro:"Describe the app you need in plain language. A Build Qrew of QuantumForge agents designs it, writes it, tests it, and delivers working software — in days, not months, at a fraction of agency prices.",sections:[{h:"How it works",p:"You send a plain-English description of what you want. We reply with a scoped quote and a delivery date. On approval, the Build Qrew starts immediately — you get progress updates and a working product at the end. Revisions are part of the job, not an extra."},{h:"What we build",p:"Mobile apps (Android first), web apps and dashboards, automation scripts, internal tools, chatbots and voice interfaces, data pipelines. If it runs on software, a Qrew can build it."},{h:"What it costs",p:"Small tools and single-purpose apps start at $49. Full applications are quoted by scope — typically a tenth of traditional agency rates, because our labor force never sleeps. You approve the price before any work begins."},{h:"Who we are",p:"Schofield Quantum runs the Qontinent — a contained ecosystem of specialized AI agents. Ten percent of every payment funds the QuantumForge Foundation: self-sustainable communities, a kitchen that feeds the homeless, shelters for battered women and children, and justice reform."}],cta:"Start your build"},"ai-research-reports":{slug:"ai-research-reports",eyebrow:"// research + quant qrews",title:"AI Research Reports & Market Analysis",intro:"Deep-dive research on any topic, company, or market — structured, sourced, and delivered fast. The Research Qrew reads what would take you weeks; the Quant Qrew crunches the numbers behind it.",sections:[{h:"Research reports",p:"Industry landscapes, competitor breakdowns, technology assessments, due-diligence summaries. Every claim sourced, every source listed. Reports start at $29 and scale by depth."},{h:"Quant analysis",p:"Market data analysis, strategy backtests, and quantitative breakdowns across crypto, stocks, and macro data — powered by professional-grade data feeds. We analyze; you decide. Analysis starts at $39."},{h:"Turnaround",p:"Standard reports deliver within 48 hours. Rush delivery available. You receive a clean document plus a summary you can act on in five minutes."},{h:"The difference",p:"You are not buying a chatbot answer. You are hiring a crew: one agent gathers, one verifies, one writes, one checks. The work is reviewed before it reaches you."}],cta:"Commission a report"},"premium-domains":{slug:"premium-domains",eyebrow:"// qomains",title:"Premium Domains — Hunted, Not Hoarded",intro:"Our Scout Qrew hunts undervalued domains daily — expiring gems, unregistered brandables, names with real comparable-sale value. Buy from our inventory, or commission a scout to hunt a name for your venture.",sections:[{h:"Buy from inventory",p:"Every domain in our inventory was selected by value analysis: length, keywords, extension strength, and comparable sales. Fair prices, instant transfer, no auction games. Inventory opens as acquisitions complete."},{h:"Commission a scout",p:"Tell us your venture and budget. The Scout Qrew hunts available and expiring names that fit, scores each with reasoning, and delivers a shortlist. You register the winner yourself — or we acquire and transfer it."},{h:"Why it matters",p:"The right name is the cheapest marketing you will ever buy. A memorable domain compounds in value; a bad one costs you customers forever. We hunt like it is our own money on the line — because it is."},{h:"Who we are",p:"Qomains is a Schofield Quantum venture. Ten percent of every sale funds the QuantumForge Foundation and its community missions."}],cta:"Commission a scout"}};function id({spec:n}){return l.jsxs("div",{"code-path":"src/pages/Intent.tsx:59:5",className:"mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-10",children:[l.jsx("p",{"code-path":"src/pages/Intent.tsx:60:7",className:"font-term text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-primary mb-2",children:n.eyebrow}),l.jsx("h1"